+ * while a CS HEAP_SET register can still point at them: the firmware then
+ * walks whatever now lives at the old chunk VAs as a chunk list and faults
+ * on a garbage pointer (exception 0xc0 CSG fatal at a wild sideband
+ * address).  Returns a free slot, or -1 when every slot is still in use. */
